lays**: In some systems, there may be delays in the feedback loop, which can affect stability and performance.\n\n6. **Advanced Topics**:\n   - **Adaptive Control**: Systems that can adjust their behavior based on changes in their environment or the system itself.\n   - **Predictive Control**: Uses future information to optimize the system's behavior.\n   - **Machine Learning**: Can be used to improve the performance of control systems by learning from data and adapting their behavior over time.\n\n### Why They Matter:\nControl systems are essential for creating more efficient, safer, and more reliable machines and processes. They enable automation, which",
